# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Campaign material, archived out of main
#
# These trees were moved to the archive/campaign-2026 branch and tag (and, for
# uncommitted working-tree state, archive/pre-cleanup-worktree-20261023). They
# are still on disk here, and tens of gigabytes of untracked run output sits
# interleaved with them, so they are ignored rather than deleted. Nothing was
# destroyed; it simply stops presenting itself as pending repository work.
#
# Recover any of it with:
#   git checkout archive/campaign-2026 -- <path>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/evidence/
/golden/
/teams/
/capabilities.yaml
/integrations/cannbench/comparisons/
/integrations/cannbench/pyasc-v2-source/
/integrations/cannbench/submission/
/integrations/cannbench/submissions/
/integrations/cannbench/workers/runs/
/integrations/cannbench/.uploads/

# Local run areas that are evidence, not repository content: build scratch,
# qualification runs, campaign state, generated reports.
/release/
/.ci-campaigns/
/dashboard/
/reports/
/.pytest_cache/
/build.pid
/_site/
/scratch/
/generative-archive/
/CANONICAL.json

# Matrix-run orchestrator logs (forensic records; kept on disk only).
run-matrix-log-*.csv
rerun-phase9.log
rerun-phase10-*.log

# CANNBench worker scratch and local runtime distributions.
/integrations/cannbench/.qemu-runtime-dist/
/integrations/cannbench/.camodel-runtime-dist/
/integrations/cannbench/.camodel-venv/
/integrations/cannbench/workers/.scratch/

# Self-hosted runner secrets: the PAT-bearing .env lives only on the runner
# hosts, never in the repo. The committed template is .env.example.
infra/self-hosted-runner/.env

# (The docker/ overlay and bundle entries that used to live here went away
# with the self-built simulator images; see reference/images/ENV.json.)

# Cursor plan files are per-session working notes, not project documentation.
# Eleven campaign-era plans were tracked by accident; three embedded absolute
# home paths. Durable decisions belong in docs/.
.cursor/plans/
